    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 510 reported an opening gross claims outstanding of GBP 1,307.4m at the start of 2017. During the year there was a net favourable reassessment of prior accident years of GBP 20.9m (net), recorded as a surplus in the technical account and described as reassessment of net claims for previous accident years (a release). The improvement reflects favourable claims development across the portfolio, in particular on property-exposed classes and some reinsurance prior-year reserve releases, despite significant 2017 catastrophe activity (Harvey, Irma, Maria, California wildfires and Mexico earthquakes) which affected the open year. The prior-year movement figure available in the report is presented net of reinsurance; no explicit gross prior-year movement amount was stated.",
